  id: order-curfew
  shape: 6
  kind: 1
  title: MARTIAL LAW IN EFFECT AT SIX TONIGHT
  body: '"By order of the Garrison Command: all street assemblies are banned starting
    at 18:00. Patrols have orders to fire without warning on anyone found outside
    after the evening siren. Lock your shutters, stay away from the windows, and
    wait for morning instructions."'
